<binaryimage arch="AARCH64:LE:64:v8A:default">
<!--
    Mach-O __unwind_info function starts (`option unwindstarts on|off`).

    Issue: a Mach-O whose LC_FUNCTION_STARTS was stripped loses almost its whole
    function inventory. On a decrypted 249 MB arm64 Instagram.app with no
    LC_FUNCTION_STARTS, kuna discovered 23 of the real __text functions; the
    rest of its 59,222 entries were __got slots and __stubs. arm64 has no
    default prologue sweep, so LC_MAIN, the exports, __mod_init_func and the
    symbol table are the only seeds and nothing starts a function between them.
    __TEXT,__unwind_info survives the strip and still records 204,800 starts.

    Stage / sub-stage: P1 code-data-partition, the Mach-O entry-discovery
    oracles (`kuna-analysis/src/analyzers/entry/kuna_unwindinfo.rs`), committed
    at `read symbols`.

    P0 assertion: `option unwindstarts on|off` (default off). It is set after
    `load file` and before the `read symbols` that commits the discovered
    entries. The default pass runs first with the option never set.

    The XML wrapper only supplies the harness architecture. Both passes clear
    it and load the real arm64 Mach-O fixture `macho_unwind_only_arm64` (built
    from `macho_unwind_only_arm64.c`): LC_FUNCTION_STARTS and the local symbols
    are stripped, and four `uw_*` functions with no caller and no symbol are
    recorded only in __unwind_info (each has its own stack size, so the linker
    does not fold their entries).

    Pass 1 (the default, the BUG): `functions` lists only `_main`; the four
    unwind-only bodies are absent from the inventory. Pass 2 (`option
    unwindstarts on`, the FIX): the four starts are listed, and one of them
    (uw_delta, a 320-byte buffer fill and sum) decompiles as a function.
-->
<bytechunk space="ram" offset="0x100000" readonly="true">
c0035fd6
</bytechunk>
<symbol space="ram" offset="0x100000" name="harness_stub"/>
</binaryimage>
<script>
  <com>clear architecture</com>
  <com>load file decompiler/crates/kuna-analysis/tests/fixtures/macho_unwind_only_arm64</com>
  <com>read symbols</com>
  <com>functions</com>
  <com>clear architecture</com>
  <com>load file decompiler/crates/kuna-analysis/tests/fixtures/macho_unwind_only_arm64</com>
  <com>option unwindstarts on</com>
  <com>read symbols</com>
  <com>functions</com>
  <com>load function sub_1000003bc</com>
  <com>decompile</com>
  <com>print C</com>
  <com>quit</com>
</script>
